{"hw":"ἀκέω1","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀκέω1</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀκέω</span> (A), <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> v. ἀκέομαι sub fin.</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀκέω2</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀκέω</span> (B), <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be silent</b>(cf.sq.), only opt. <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀκέοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.R.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.765</span> </span>.</div></div>"}